<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH JULY PPI UP 0.7 PCT MO/MO, 5.1 PCT YR/YR-CSU.</title>
<headline>CZECH JULY PPI UP 0.7 PCT MO/MO, 5.1 PCT YR/YR-CSU.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech producer prices were 0.7 percent higher in July, putting industrial prices 5.1 percent higher than in the same month in 1996, the Czech Statistical Bureau (CSU) said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>  CZECH PRODUCER PRICES   JULY 1997 JUNE 1997  JULY 1997</p>
<p>Industrial</p>
<p>  pct change month/month     0.7	  0.5	  0.2</p>
<p>  pct change year/year	 5.1	  4.5	  4.4</p>
<p>Construction prices</p>
<p>  pct change month/month     1.0	  0.7	  0.7</p>
<p>  pct change year/year	11.4	 11.1	 11.2</p>
<p>Agricultural prices</p>
<p>  pct change month/month     n/a	  n/a	  n/a</p>
<p>  pct change year/year	 5.1	  0.9	  8.8</p>
<p>NOTE: Construction figures are based on estimates. All figures are in real, inflation-adjusted terms.</p>
<p>-- Robin, Shepherd Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
